{"animath":"0.1","title":"The water cycle","level":"primary","subject":"science","topic":"water-cycle","kind":"concept","canvas":{"width":960,"height":540},"scenes":[{"id":"s1","caption":"Evaporation: water rises as vapour","narration":"The sun heats the sea. The water gets warm and rises into the air as an invisible gas called water vapour.","duration_ms":6000,"steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"sun","kind":"circle","cx":810,"cy":100,"r":60,"fill":"#ffdd55","stroke":"#e6b800","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":300,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"sea","kind":"rect","x":60,"y":400,"w":840,"h":140,"fill":"#7fb3e8","stroke":"#3a7bd5","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"seaLabel","kind":"text","x":90,"y":470,"text":"Sea","size":32,"color":"#123c7a"}},{"at_ms":900,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"arrow1","kind":"arrow","x1":300,"y1":380,"x2":300,"y2":320,"stroke":"#e07b00","width":4}},{"at_ms":1100,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"arrow2","kind":"arrow","x1":480,"y1":380,"x2":480,"y2":320,"stroke":"#e07b00","width":4}},{"at_ms":1300,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"drop1","kind":"circle","cx":300,"cy":330,"r":12,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":1400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"drop2","kind":"circle","cx":480,"cy":330,"r":12,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":1700,"do":"move","target":"drop1","to":{"cx":300,"cy":190},"dur_ms":1800},{"at_ms":1750,"do":"move","target":"drop2","to":{"cx":480,"cy":190},"dur_ms":1800},{"at_ms":3800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"heat","kind":"text","x":120,"y":120,"text":"Heat rises the water up","size":32,"color":"#b35500"}},{"at_ms":4600,"do":"caption","text":"The water did not disappear — it became invisible vapour"}]},{"id":"s2","caption":"Condensation: vapour becomes cloud","narration":"High up, the air is cold. The water vapour cools down and turns back into tiny drops of water that gather into clouds.","duration_ms":6000,"steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"coldAir","kind":"text","x":120,"y":80,"text":"Cold air","size":30,"color":"#3a7bd5"}},{"at_ms":400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"dropA","kind":"circle","cx":380,"cy":150,"r":10,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"dropB","kind":"circle","cx":480,"cy":160,"r":10,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"dropC","kind":"circle","cx":580,"cy":150,"r":10,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":1400,"do":"move","target":"dropA","to":{"cx":430,"cy":250},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":1500,"do":"move","target":"dropB","to":{"cx":480,"cy":250},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":1600,"do":"move","target":"dropC","to":{"cx":530,"cy":250},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":3400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c1","kind":"circle","cx":400,"cy":260,"r":55,"fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#9aa5b1","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":3600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c2","kind":"circle","cx":480,"cy":240,"r":65,"fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#9aa5b1","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":3800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c3","kind":"circle","cx":560,"cy":260,"r":55,"fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#9aa5b1","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":4200,"do":"emphasize","target":"c2","dur_ms":900},{"at_ms":5000,"do":"caption","text":"Tiny drops join together — a cloud is born"}]},{"id":"s3","caption":"Precipitation: water falls as rain","narration":"The drops in the cloud get bigger and heavier. When they are too heavy to float, they fall as rain.","duration_ms":6000,"steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c1","kind":"circle","cx":400,"cy":180,"r":55,"fill":"#8f9aa6","stroke":"#5b6672","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c2","kind":"circle","cx":480,"cy":160,"r":65,"fill":"#8f9aa6","stroke":"#5b6672","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"c3","kind":"circle","cx":560,"cy":180,"r":55,"fill":"#8f9aa6","stroke":"#5b6672","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":900,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"rain1","kind":"arrow","x1":400,"y1":250,"x2":400,"y2":300,"stroke":"#3a7bd5","width":4}},{"at_ms":1100,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"rain2","kind":"arrow","x1":480,"y1":240,"x2":480,"y2":290,"stroke":"#3a7bd5","width":4}},{"at_ms":1300,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"rain3","kind":"arrow","x1":560,"y1":250,"x2":560,"y2":300,"stroke":"#3a7bd5","width":4}},{"at_ms":1800,"do":"move","target":"rain1","to":{"x1":400,"y1":400,"x2":400,"y2":450},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":1900,"do":"move","target":"rain2","to":{"x1":480,"y1":400,"x2":480,"y2":450},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":2000,"do":"move","target":"rain3","to":{"x1":560,"y1":400,"x2":560,"y2":450},"dur_ms":1400},{"at_ms":3800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"rainLabel","kind":"text","x":620,"y":440,"text":"Rain","size":36,"color":"#123c7a"}},{"at_ms":4700,"do":"caption","text":"Heavy drops fall — we call this precipitation"}]},{"id":"s4","caption":"Watch out: water is not gone for good once it evaporates","narration":"Watch out: it is tempting to think water disappears for good once it evaporates. But the water turns invisible as vapour, so it looks like it has gone away. It is still there as invisible vapour; cooled into clouds it falls back as rain and returns to the sea, and the cycle starts again.","duration_ms":6000,"steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"mountain","kind":"polygon","points":[[150,420],[280,160],[410,420]],"fill":"#b8c4ae","stroke":"#6b7a5e","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"sea","kind":"rect","x":560,"y":400,"w":340,"h":140,"fill":"#7fb3e8","stroke":"#3a7bd5","strokeWidth":3}},{"at_ms":800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"river","kind":"arrow","x1":300,"y1":220,"x2":420,"y2":380,"stroke":"#3a7bd5","width":8}},{"at_ms":1000,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"riverLabel","kind":"text","x":230,"y":250,"text":"River","size":30,"color":"#123c7a"}},{"at_ms":1400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"flow","kind":"circle","cx":300,"cy":220,"r":10,"fill":"#5a9bd4"}},{"at_ms":1800,"do":"move","target":"flow","to":{"cx":520,"cy":430},"dur_ms":1800},{"at_ms":4000,"do":"emphasize","target":"sea","dur_ms":1000},{"at_ms":5000,"do":"caption","text":"The cycle never ends — round and round it goes"}]}]}